      "text": "VERIFY frame (a STATICCALL)\n1. SIGDATACOPY: the FORS+C signature\n2. digest = keccak(DOMAIN, sigHash)\n3. LeanFors recovers the key: 53.6k gas\n4. approve(EXECUTION_AND_PAYMENT)",
